  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "Hanko",
  "abstract": "Open-source, passkey-first authentication and user management written in Go, with a hosted Hanko Cloud and a self-hosted backend under AGPL-3.0. Offers passkeys, passwords, email passcodes, social and custom OIDC sign-in, SAML enterprise SSO, passkey-based and OTP MFA, organizations and roles, webhooks, a Flow API, and drop-in Hanko Elements web components. Sessions are validated in your backend with JWTs and JWKS. Built by Hanko GmbH in Germany.",
